        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS take great pleasure in introducing this charming three-bedroom semi-detached bungalow sitting on a large site which is prime for development to the market on the highly sought after Blessington Road, Dublin 24 situated right between Citywest & Tallaght. Citywest is proving to be one of Dublin's most sought-after locations and is it any wonder why? Within a short stroll you will find a variety of local shops & shopping centres along with the LUAS bringing you to the heart of Dublin's City Centre. Within minutes you will find Saggart Village with its shops, schools, Avoca and local GAA grounds along with the N7, M50 and a host of bus routes. Citywest Shopping centre is also found within walking distance and Tallaght Square Shopping Centre is less than 10 minutes away. \r\n\r\nBright, airy & most spacious internal living accommodation of c. 92 sqm comprises of entrance hallway, living room with fireplace, separate office/study room, fully fitted kitchen, three double bedrooms and main family bathroom which comes fully tiled. A porch is located off your kitchen which leads onto a sizable site to the side and rear as you are sitting on 0.56 of an acre which offers the perfect opportunity for any keen developer to develop the site, you also have the use of a block built garage to the side which is great for additional storage or can be used for many different purposes. There is ample parking to the side of the house also. \r\n\r\nNo. 2 Gibbons Cottages comes to the market in good condition throughout but could use some modernisation. Due to its size and location it has the potential to be a fantastic home and sitting on such a large site the scope for further development is endless, it boasts key features such as spacious living throughout, fully fitted kitchen, open fireplace and fully tiled bathroom to name but a few. We expect this to be popular amongst a wide range of buyers such as any keen investor looking to capitalise on strong rents, any developers looking for a large site or anyone looking to downsize to a charming and loving bungalow. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly advised - Contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today.! \r\n\r\nAdditional Features; \r\n- c. 92 sqm \r\n- BER E2\r\n- 3 bed / 1 bath\r\n- Semi-detached bungalow \r\n- Sitting on large site \r\n- 0.56 of an acre\r\n- Prime for future development \r\n- Privately enclosed \r\n- Large garage to the side\r\n- Plenty of additional storage \r\n- Good condition throughout \r\n- Could use some modernisation\r\n- Entrance hallway \r\n- Living room with fireplace \r\n- Separate office/study room \r\n- Fully fitted kitchen \r\n- Three generous bedrooms \r\n- Main family bathroom full tiled \r\n- Porch located off the kitchen \r\n- Oil fired central heating system \r\n- Ample storage throughout the house\r\n- Ample parking to the side \r\n- Peaceful location \r\n- Located in the middle of Citywest & Tallaght \r\n- Highly sought-after area \r\n- All local amenities within a short stroll \r\n- Ideal for a wide range of buyers\r\n- Viewing highly advised \r\n\r\nDirections - D24H6YE"
      },
